<com.inphonik.RX1200 name="Drum Kit Stadium" author="William Lamy / Inphonik" comment="This is William's drum set in the same setting as the Hall kit, except the mix takes advantage of an extra microphone placed far from the drum kit, pointing at the shed's wall. Heavily compressing this mic's signal turns the drum sound into a monster that would eat any guitarist alive.">
